# A shaped drive on hole 1 of the test course on the TX: the fourth app
# button (hard4) picks a fade, the 5-way aims a degree left and the centre
# does the three swing clicks, 95 % power with the snap on time. Then the
# other app buttons: hard2 opens the map and closes it, hard3 opens the
# scorecard and closes it. Start it on the tee view once it's drawn.
0 key-down hard4
80 key-up hard4
300 key-down hard4
380 key-up hard4
800 key-down left
860 key-up left
1500 snapshot "{out}/s1-aim.png"
2000 key-down center
2060 key-up center
2950 key-down center
3010 key-up center
3660 key-down center
3720 key-up center
5500 snapshot "{out}/s1-flight.png"
8500 snapshot "{out}/s1-roll.png"
10500 snapshot "{out}/s1-result.png"
11000 snapshot "{out}/s1-result2.png"
20000 snapshot "{out}/s2-aim.png"
21000 key-down hard2
21080 key-up hard2
24000 snapshot "{out}/map.png"
24500 key-down hard2
24580 key-up hard2
28000 snapshot "{out}/back.png"
28500 key-down hard3
28580 key-up hard3
30000 snapshot "{out}/card.png"
30500 key-down hard3
30580 key-up hard3
33000 snapshot "{out}/after-card.png"
33500 key-down hard1
33560 key-up hard1
34500 snapshot "{out}/hard1-meter.png"
